WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.472
[Gentle music]
Hover a symbol to see exactly what it is. In F#, SharpLsp shows the signature the compiler inferred, with your doc comment underneath.

00:19.217 --> 00:25.185
Union cases work the same way, and so do .NET types, shown just as F# sees them.

00:37.083 --> 00:43.715
C# hovers come from Roslyn: your XML docs, rendered, and the real type behind every var.

00:55.083 --> 01:01.061
And hover reads the code you haven't saved. Change a doc comment, and the next hover already shows it.
